      "id": "PM-14",
      "title": "NEC4 ECC (Option A/C): Early Warnings & Compensation Events",
      "desc": "Administer collaborative NEC4 contracts: Accepted Programme updates, Risk Reduction Meetings, CEs, and Option C target pain/gainshare.",
      "tags": [
        "NEC4 ECC",
        "Option A/C",
        "CE"
      ],
      "folder": "Phase_3_Procurement_Contracts_RIBA_4\\PM-14_NEC4_ECC_Early_Warnings_CE",
      "keyFacts": [
        "Contract Forms: NEC4 ECC Option A (Priced) & Option C (Target Pain/Gain)",
        "Cl. 15 Early Warning: Mutual proactive notification + Risk Reduction Meeting",
        "Cl. 31/32 Programme: Accepted Programme prerequisite (25% payment hold risk)",
        "Cl. 60-65 CE: Contractor Time-Bar 8 weeks from awareness",
        "Prospective Pricing: CE quoted on Defined Cost + Fee forecast, not hindsight"
      ],
      "readme": "# PM-14: NEC4 ECC (Option A/C): Early Warnings & Compensation Events\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 3: Procurement, Contracts & Supply Chain (RIBA 4)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 4-6`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `Execution Horizon`\n- **WBS Scope**: `WBS 4.0-6.0`\n- **Governing Standards**: NEC4 ECC Option A (Priced) & Option C (Target Cost) Z-Clauses\n- **Focus Areas**: Cl. 15 Early Warning, Cl. 31/32 Programme, Cl. 60-65 Comp. Events, Risk Reduction, Pain/Gainshare\n\n## Module Overview\nAdminister collaborative NEC4 contracts: Accepted Programme updates, Risk Reduction Meetings, CEs, and Option C target pain/gainshare.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | NEC4 Engineering & Construction Contract (Options A & C Guidance Notes) | `PM14_Doc1_Standard_NEC4_Engineering_Construction_Rev.004.docx` | NEC4 ECC Clauses 10-95 |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | NEC4 Works Information (Scope), Contract Data Part 1/2 & Pain/Gainshare Model | `PM14_Doc2_Deliverable_NEC4_Works_Information_Scope_Rev.004.docx` | NEC4 Contract Pack |\n| Doc 3 | Template | Live Early Warning Notice (EWN) & Risk Reduction Meeting Action Register | `PM14_Doc3_Template_Live_Early_Warning_Notice_EWN_Risk_Rev.004.xlsx` | NEC4 Clause 15 Workflow |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | Compensation Event (CE) Valuation Register & Clause 31/32 Programme Check | `PM14_Doc4_Audit_Compensation_Event_CE_Valuation_Rev.004.xlsx` | NEC4 Cl. 31-32 & 60-65 |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Master collaborative PM duties, time bars (Clause 61.3), and target cost gainshare.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Draft unambiguous Scope specs and Option C share ranges aligned with sponsor budgets.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Surface cost/programme threats early before they convert into expensive Compensation Events.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Enforce strict prospective time-impact quoting and Defined Cost substantiation.\n",
