      "id": "PM-15",
      "title": "FIDIC Yellow / Silver Book: Risk Allocation & Claims Control",
      "desc": "Manage Engineer determinations, Employer Requirements integrity, EOT substantiation, and DAB dispute avoidance under FIDIC.",
      "tags": [
        "FIDIC",
        "Claims",
        "EOT"
      ],
      "folder": "Phase_3_Procurement_Contracts_RIBA_4\\PM-15_FIDIC_Yellow_Silver_Claims",
      "keyFacts": [
        "Contract Forms: FIDIC 2017 Yellow Book (D&B) & Silver Book (Turnkey EPC)",
        "Cl. 3.7 Determinations: 42-day consultation then fair determination",
        "Cl. 20 Claims: Strict 28-day Notice of Claim time-bar; detailed claim 84d",
        "Cl. 21 DAAB: Standing Dispute Avoidance / Adjudication Board",
        "Delay Protocol: SCL Time Impact Analysis (TIA) on critical path only"
      ],
      "readme": "# PM-15: FIDIC Yellow / Silver Book: Risk Allocation & Claims Control\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 3: Procurement, Contracts & Supply Chain (RIBA 4)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 4-6`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `Execution Horizon`\n- **WBS Scope**: `WBS 3.0-5.0`\n- **Governing Standards**: FIDIC 2017 Yellow Book (D&B) & Silver Book (EPC), SCL Delay Protocol\n- **Focus Areas**: Employer's Reqs (ERs), Cl. 3.7 Determinations, Cl. 20 Claims, Cl. 21 DAAB, Time Impact EOT\n\n## Module Overview\nManage Engineer determinations, Employer Requirements integrity, EOT substantiation, and DAB dispute avoidance under FIDIC.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | FIDIC Yellow Book (D&B) / Silver Book (EPC) 2017 & SCL Delay Protocol | `PM15_Doc1_Standard_FIDIC_Yellow_Book_D_B_Silver_Book_Rev.004.docx` | FIDIC 2017 / SCL Protocol |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Employer's Requirements (ERs), Particular Conditions & Delay Damages Schedule | `PM15_Doc2_Deliverable_Employer_s_Requirements_ERs_Rev.004.docx` | FIDIC Contract Drafting |\n| Doc 3 | Template | Contractor Notice of Claim, Time-Impact EOT Analysis & Determination SOP | `PM15_Doc3_Template_Contractor_Notice_of_Claim_Time_Rev.004.docx` | FIDIC Clause 20 / 3.7 |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | Dispute Avoidance/Adjudication Board (DAAB) Monthly Standing Briefing Audit | `PM15_Doc4_Audit_Dispute_Avoidance_Adjudication_Rev.004.docx` | FIDIC Clause 21 DAAB |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Understand Employer Risk vs. turnkey single-point responsibility under Irish/EU law.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Protect power efficiency guarantees and liquidated damages via airtight ER schedules.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Evaluate concurrent delay, pacing, and Sub-Clause 20.2 condition-precedent notices.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Resolve commercial entitlement deadlocks contemporaneously to avoid arbitration.\n",
