      "id": "PM-16",
      "title": "OFCI Long-Lead Equipment Strategy (HV, UPS, Chillers, BESS)",
      "desc": "De-risk 40-80 week OEM bottlenecks via early Owner-Furnished slots, milestone reservation payments, and novation options.",
      "tags": [
        "OFCI",
        "Long-Lead",
        "OEM"
      ],
      "folder": "Phase_3_Procurement_Contracts_RIBA_4\\PM-16_OFCI_Long_Lead_Equipment",
      "keyFacts": [
        "OFCI Fleet: 2x 63MVA Tx | 22kV SF6-Free GIS | 20x 2.5MVA HVO | 45x 1000kVA UPS | 8x 1200RT Chillers | BESS",
        "Milestone: M3120 OEM Delivery (+200d Supply Chain Resilience Buffer)",
        "De-Risking: Paid slot reservation fees during LNTP before FNTP",
        "Novation: Client-placed POs transferred cleanly under Contractor custody",
        "HVO Tanks: 4x 80 m3 EN 15940 tanks (72h continuous N+1 fuel autonomy)"
      ],
      "readme": "# PM-16: OFCI Long-Lead Equipment Strategy (HV, UPS, Chillers, BESS)\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 3: Procurement, Contracts & Supply Chain (RIBA 4)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 3-5`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `M3120 (+200d Buffer)`\n- **WBS Scope**: `WBS 3.0-PROC`\n- **Governing Standards**: Client OFCI Supply Protocol, FAT QA & Novation Deeds\n- **Focus Areas**: 2x 63MVA Tx, 22kV SF6-Free GIS, 20x 2.5MVA HVO, 45x 1000kVA UPS, Grid BESS & 8x Chillers\n\n## Module Overview\nDe-risk 40-80 week OEM bottlenecks via early Owner-Furnished slots, milestone reservation payments, and novation options.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | Hyperscale Owner-Furnished Contractor-Installed (OFCI) Procurement Protocol | `PM16_Doc1_Standard_Hyperscale_Owner_Furnished_Rev.004.docx` | OFCI Delivery Standard |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Master OFCI Long-Lead Equipment Matrix (110kV GIS, Transformers, UPS, BESS) | `PM16_Doc2_Deliverable_OFCI_LongLead_Matrix_PIP_Master_Rev.004.xlsx` | Sheet 5. Contracting & OFCI |\n| Doc 3 | Template | OEM Slot Reservation Agreement, Progress Milestones & Conditional Novation Deed | `PM16_Doc3_Template_OEM_Slot_Reservation_Agreement_Rev.004.docx` | HV / UPS / Chiller Supply |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | OFCI Factory Warranty Transition, Site Receiving, Rigging & Custody Audit | `PM16_Doc4_Audit_OFCI_Factory_Warranty_Transition_Rev.004.xlsx` | Care & Custody Transfer |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Balance 52-week OEM lead-time compression against interface liability risks.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Track factory build slots, deposit milestones, and required-on-site dates in P6.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Lock factory production early and cleanly transfer custody to the EPCm at site delivery.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Verify crane paths, floor point-loads, and preservation warranty compliance on arrival.\n",
