      "id": "PM-17",
      "title": "RFP Issuance, Technical Bid Evaluation (TBE) & BAFO Leveling",
      "desc": "Run blind commercial/technical scoring matrices, normalize exclusions/deviations, and lead structured BAFO negotiations.",
      "tags": [
        "TBE",
        "BAFO",
        "Procurement"
      ],
      "folder": "Phase_3_Procurement_Contracts_RIBA_4\\PM-17_RFP_TBE_BAFO_Leveling",
      "keyFacts": [
        "Tender Separation: Blind Technical Bid Evaluation (TBE) before Commercial open",
        "BAFO Leveling: Normalize exclusions, Incoterms, VAT & bonds apples-to-apples",
        "Audit Trail: Sealed bid opening log + Clarification Register (RFI)",
        "RTA Gate: Investment Committee / SteerCo Recommendation to Award",
        "Pricing Base: Itemized RICS NRM1 / BoQ unit rate benchmarking"
      ],
      "readme": "# PM-17: RFP Issuance, Technical Bid Evaluation (TBE) & BAFO Leveling\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 3: Procurement, Contracts & Supply Chain (RIBA 4)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 4`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `Pre-Award Gate`\n- **WBS Scope**: `WBS 3.0-5.0`\n- **Governing Standards**: EU Competitive Tender Audit Rules, Blind TBE & BAFO Commercial Leveling\n- **Focus Areas**: ITT / RFP Dossier, Pricing BoQ, Weighted TBE, BAFO Equalization, IC Recommendation to Award\n\n## Module Overview\nRun blind commercial/technical scoring matrices, normalize exclusions/deviations, and lead structured BAFO negotiations.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | EU Competitive Tender Governance & Commercial Bid Normalisation Best Practice | `PM17_Doc1_Standard_EU_Competitive_Tender_Governance_Rev.004.docx` | Audit-Ready Tender Rules |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Invitation to Tender (ITT) / RFP Package, Pricing BoQ & Mandatory Compliances | `PM17_Doc2_Deliverable_Invitation_to_Tender_ITT_RFP_Rev.004.docx` | RIBA Stage 4 Tender Pack |\n| Doc 3 | Template | Blind Technical Bid Evaluation (TBE) Scorecard & BAFO Leveling Sheet | `PM17_Doc3_Template_Blind_Technical_Bid_Evaluation_TBE_Rev.004.xlsx` | Tech / Cost / Schedule / HSE |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | Post-Tender Clarification Log & Executive Recommendation to Award (RTA) Paper | `PM17_Doc4_Audit_Post_Tender_Clarification_Log_Rev.004.docx` | IC Award Approval |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Guarantee transparent, defensible contractor selection under institutional governance.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Issue standardized pricing schedules so bids can be compared apples-to-apples.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Plug gaps, price exclusions, and benchmark labour productivity rates across bidders.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Document BAFO savings, negotiated risk caps, and final contract execution readiness.\n",
